<title>USA: CCC seeks soy-fortified cornmeal for Rwanda, Benin.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks soy-fortified cornmeal for Rwanda, Benin.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on December 9 for 9,200 tonnes of soy-fortified cornmeal for shipment between January 6 and February 5, 1997.</p>
<p>The meal comprised 8,840 tonnes for export to Rwanda and 360 tonnes destined for Benin.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
</text>
